# test list operations


>> cakes := ਲਿਸਟ ←
	['apple'] ;
	['berry'] ;
	['choco'] ;
	['cheese'].


>> buy := cakes ਬਦਲੋ: 1 ਲੰਬਾਈ: 2 ਨਾਲ: ( ਲਿਸਟ ← ['cinnamon'] ; ['pineapple'] ).
ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: (buy ਜੋੜੋ: [',']), ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.


>> buy := cakes ਬਦਲੋ: 1 ਲੰਬਾਈ: 12 ਨਾਲ: ( ਲਿਸਟ ← ['cinnamon'] ; ['pineapple'] ).
